    {
      "id": "claim_46f84f4599124d9c9d05399523c22545",
      "statement": "P2 items include: SyncController.stop() is not idempotent (a double stop can double-run the on-stop callback); portal SelectSources/Start GLib loops have no timeout and can block the sync thread forever; dead code (ZoneMapping, data/default_settings.json, HueBridge.set_zone_color, superseded entertainment channel-mapping helpers); no real logging beyond print; and packaging notes (no wheels for PyGObject/pycairo, unpinned zeroconf with a leaked close() on the exception path, unguarded pydbus import, verify the Flatpak runtime ships pipewiresrc).",
