      "id": "claim_aac58f9657384ed0b9da7de24ea68c04",
      "statement": "The performance knobs are: CaptureSettings.scale_factor (default 0.125, clamped 0.01-1.0) which scales the GStreamer pipeline target dimensions and triggers a pipeline restart on change; SyncSettings.fps (default 30, clamped 1-60) which the sync loop re-reads every frame and sleeps against as 1/fps - elapsed so changes apply live; and SyncSettings.smoothing_factor (default 0.3, clamped 0.1-1.0) which drives ColorAnalyzer.apply_smoothing lerp before each light update — matching the README's performance tips (lower scale, 15-30 fps, more smoothing) and troubleshooting section (portal config, bridge network, CPU knobs).",
